      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEOPATRA.\nIndeed, he is so. I repent me much\nThat so I harried him. Why, methinks, by him,\nThis creature’s no such thing.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
