      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEOPATRA.\nI have one thing more to ask him yet, good Charmian.\nBut ’tis no matter; thou shalt bring him to me\nWhere I will write. All may be well enough.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
